OL,4,CTwo children among six dead after      
OL,5,Cplane crash off Mississippi coast      
OL,6,GSix people, including two children,    
OL,7,Ghave been found dead after a plane     
OL,8,Gcrashed off the coast of Mississippi   
OL,9,Gon Tuesday, the US Coast Guard says.   
OL,11,FThe Cessna 210 was on its way from New 
OL,12,FOrleans to Fort Myers, Florida,        
OL,13,Faccording to the flight tracking       
OL,14,Fwebsite FlightAware. Air traffic       
OL,15,Fcontrol lost touch with it at about    
OL,16,F15:45 (21:45 GMT) and it later went    
OL,17,Fdown in the Gulf of Mexico between     
OL,18,FPascagoula and Horn Island, officials  
OL,19,Fsaid.                                  
